OL,5,G0105 Emergency Helicopter Medics
OL,6,     FThe heli-medics attend a car crash
OL,7,     Fin Northumberland, and treat a man
OL,8,     Fwith a dangerously fast heartbeat
OL,9,     Fand a cyclist who's had a nasty
OL,10,     Fcrash in a remote part of Cumbria.
OL,11,G0205 999: On the Front Line
OL,12,     FBrand new series: Paramedics treat
OL,13,     Fa motorcyclist who's flung over
OL,14,     Ftheir handlebars, a woman having a
OL,15,     Fpanic attack and a patient with
OL,16,     Fchest pain and a history of
OL,17,     Fcardiac issues.
